,{"type":"p","text":"“Registered Unani physician combining clinical Unani practice, preventive healthcare, community medicine, patient safety and modern evidence-based healthcare skills.”"},{"type":"p","text":"For this pathway, the student should prioritise clinical competence, safe referral, professional registration and practical patient-care experience rather than simply collecting certifications. A strong BUMS graduate should be able to provide appropriate care within the recognised scope of Unani medicine while also recognising emergencies, coordinating referrals and contributing to public-health programs."},{"type":"h","text":"The ideal long-term combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BUMS","Clinical Unani Practice","Preventive/Community Health","Emergency Recognition","Patient Safety","Research Literacy","Digital Health Skills."],"sep":"+"}]}]}